WEBVTT

00:11:28.684 --> 00:11:33.021
and they distract us
from the moneymaking tentacles

00:11:33.063 --> 00:11:36.984
that tie our future to the prison gates.

00:11:37.443 --> 00:11:39.236
Well, the thing is,

00:11:39.278 --> 00:11:46.201
liberty is too precious
for any of us to lose it

00:11:46.243 --> 00:11:49.246
because politicians want votes

00:11:49.246 --> 00:11:52.916
and private corporations want money.

00:11:53.792 --> 00:11:55.002
Thank you.

00:11:55.002 --> 00:12:02.009
(Cheers and applause)